{"server":"cn","storyId":"act33side_level_act33side_02_end","groupId":"act33side","stageId":"act33side_02","title":"命途何在","storyCode":"BB-2","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act33side/level_act33side_02_end.txt","sourceHash":"460046e649bb4917875c6907f97b0085784497b0444a45e6b5d27fb354cafb65","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们站在这艘军舰的辙印旁竟显得如此渺小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，令人惊叹的军事器械。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"食腐者的血肉防线付出极大代价才阻截了战舰的行进，女妖足以撕碎意识的尖啸也仅仅是逼迫他们舍弃舰桥，撤往下层的指挥中心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是天灾在前，加之这块峡谷地带的险要地势——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的时间真的不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡兹戴尔必须拥有同样的，甚至超越他们想象的武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们迄今为止的尝试都失败了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"百多年前，谁又相信我们能够将卡兹戴尔真的建成移动城市呢？循规蹈矩无法让卡兹戴尔追上那些国家的步伐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"变形者刚传回了消息，地平线上与我们遥遥相望的军舰都已经开始减速了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们放弃了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。选帝侯发出的指令是继续追击，但是舰队的指挥下达了减速的指令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们在害怕天灾和恶劣的地形，我们眼前这艘军舰就是前车之鉴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那按照他们的前进速度，傍晚就是决战的时候了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......足够了，我们已经拖延了充足的时间。"},{"type":"narration","text":"特蕾西娅回望荒野上两股逐渐纠缠的风暴，试图找寻那座庞大城市的踪迹。\n一无所获。卡兹戴尔如今已经到了哪里？它是否仍然在风暴中迁徙？躲藏在庇护所中的居民是否依旧安好？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那两股风暴开始聚拢了，我们的后路已经被彻底堵上了。决战不可避免，无论如何......特雷西斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你竟然会在战场上走神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"风暴在发怒，年幼者正张扬着挑衅年长者。\n新生的风暴裹挟着雷鸣撞向了奄奄一息的风暴。\n紊乱的空气流在两股风暴之间交错，融合......\n狂暴孕育平静。一条狭长的通路诞生于风暴交汇之处。\n电光闪耀，雷鸣回荡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一条路，在风暴之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"风暴......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西娅，走吧，道路已被风暴铸下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"活下来的人还有另一条路可以选。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们一起。"},{"type":"narration","text":"他们的命令在下一刻便由变形者集群传到每一位在场萨卡兹的耳中。\n战士们看到了两位领袖并肩走入风暴。无人迟疑，所有人动了起来。\n健全者搀扶虚弱者，勇敢者鼓励畏怯者。漫漫长队迈入了风暴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......特雷西斯，你看到了吗？"},{"type":"narration","text":"风暴的呼啸中，那道源自幼时梦中风雪的声音仿佛传入了他们的耳中。\n他们看到了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......预言。"},{"type":"narration","text":"裹在披风下的瘦弱身影听到了身后的声音，转身回望，看到了迎风而行的队伍。\n特雷西斯看到了一个孩子。薄暮般的烟雾拥着她的肩头，在风暴中升腾，流淌，向着高空狂啸。\n特雷西斯摘下手甲，赤手没入烟中。\n烟雾散去，他被血丝染红的手握住了孩子的石刃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（含糊不清的发音）你......啊......抓！抓到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你为什么在这？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（含糊不清的发音）家。你......家！家！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（含糊不清的发音）你！闯进！家！"},{"type":"narration","text":"孩子用力从特雷西斯手中抽出石刃，随后又指向他，向他身后漫长的队伍宣战。\n生于荒野，无惧荒野，孩子的刀下，人与野兽无异。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你想杀我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（含糊不清的发音）煞，撒......杀，你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没有人教过她怎么说话。她只是模仿着过路人的声音而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......特雷西斯？"},{"type":"narration","text":"特雷西斯俯瞰着瘦削的生命，他沉默着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"刀，该这么拿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（含糊不清的发音）你！"},{"type":"narration","text":"孩子看着特雷西斯伸出的手，犹豫片刻后便将钝刃放在了他的手上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（含糊不清的发音）......我。你！带，我......带上，我！"},{"type":"narration","text":"特雷西斯看到了特蕾西娅的眼神。\n预言。\n“弑君之刀剑，诛王之枪矛。”\n可他们从未在乎过预言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"跟我们走。萨卡兹的家不在荒野。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g3_kazdelstreet_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"“你有名字吗？”\n“名字？‘我’。”\n“那从现在起，你有新的名字了。”\n“阿斯卡纶。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"十天后\n卡兹戴尔地区，卡兹戴尔移动城市"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"医生，快看！熔炉重燃了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"动了？是城市终于开始动了？嘶......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心点！我才刚刚给你包扎好了伤口......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"医生，我得赶去熔炉那里。熔炉重燃，卡兹戴尔还在航行......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些莱塔尼亚人没能杀死我们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我，我不是说你，医生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和我一起出去看看吧，你应该和那些活下来的战士享受同样的荣誉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......不是萨卡兹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但现在不一样了，你们也是英雄，医生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去参观两位殿下指挥歌利亚们支撑着的倾斜的熔炉！去看看铁锤修复破损核心时漫天的火星！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还能去听听女妖的挽歌，死去英雄的尸体还会被放进熔炉里当做柴薪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过去这可是只有萨卡兹才配参加的庆典。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很想去，但今晚还有很多伤员等着处理呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哎，好吧好吧！这样，我去偷偷带两瓶酒回来，还有新鲜的水果，我们在这里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你哪能喝酒！而且哪有在医疗帐篷里喝酒的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小伤而已，怎么不能？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那也不行，现在你的矿石病情况比外伤严重多了！而且你酒量太差了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？你哪次看见过我喝酒......哦，我扛着那几个矿石病炸弹来找你的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么多年了，我就那一次喝过酒。平时喝不起，你也不是不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......我拦不住你，你自己去庆典不就好了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没了你少点滋味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......但我毕竟是莱塔尼亚人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，难道你是支持那些靠战争捞钱的贵族老爷的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是看不起他们，才从家里逃了出来的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就对了。嗯？等等，从家里逃出来，你难道是贵族——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不算！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可第一次见面我就在想，你的设备明显不是巴别塔掏的钱——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——算了，我不乱猜了。对你没好处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你自己去就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不觉得前线的士兵能和一个莱塔尼亚人和平相处......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小时候看我爹被莱塔尼亚人吊在下水道口羞辱的时候，我也没想过能和一个卡普里尼医生和平相处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那时候，唯一会给我们好脸色的，不是感染者，就是贫民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。不矫情了，我去去就回。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是，怎么这段时间这群萨卡兹一个个都变得这么油腔滑调......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......特蕾西娅小姐，我这也能算是更进了一步吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，呼，卡兹戴尔动起来了，以后总会好起来的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你回来就给我躺下——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，抱歉......认错人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴郁的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你的伤很严重......法术灼烧的位置一直没人帮你处理？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴郁的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱塔尼亚人干的。我的儿子死了，他们当着我的面把他活活烧死。就活了我一个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......让我看看你的伤口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴郁的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"活活烧死。他在喊，在惨叫。他被法术悬挂在空中，烧给所有人看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴郁的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的兄弟也死了，队长也死了。莱塔尼亚人身居高处，制高点，他们高举法杖的样子就像......"},{"type":"narration","text":"几乎精神错乱的萨卡兹盯着医生放在角落的莱塔尼亚法杖。\n她已经放弃的家乡，仍旧以标识的形式悬挂在法杖上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴郁的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像，真正的......"},{"type":"narration","text":"医生没有察觉到敌意。\n她掀开萨卡兹覆盖伤口的衣服，却感受到了一阵寒意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你带着武器......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴郁的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔医生","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面的守卫为什么没有检查你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴郁的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"魂灵熔炉的火光照亮了卡兹戴尔城市之上的整片夜空，恍如白昼。\n薪柴燃烧的噼啪声如同低沉的嘶吼，祭奠着死去的生命。\n那一晚，萨卡兹们都不约而同地抬起了头，他们没有看到——\n城市的一角，一处医疗阵地的灯光静悄悄地黯淡了下去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g7_councilchamber"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴郁的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魔王殿下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴郁的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么带我来这里......对了，我有好消息要汇报......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么消息？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴郁的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴郁的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魔王殿下，我们战胜了莱塔尼亚人，我和我的儿子，还有蓝血小队的所有人，我们赢了，赢了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴郁的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......魔王殿下，您不高兴吗？莫非是我们耽搁了战机......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴郁的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布莱克！我的儿子，快把作战计划拿给我看！儿子！儿子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴郁的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉殿下，我的儿子不知道哪里去了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你杀死了一个医生。一个为卡兹戴尔服务了数年的矿石病医生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴郁的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡兹戴尔？医生？不，殿下，您一定是误会了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴郁的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只会攻击那些莱塔尼亚人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西娅。你感知过他的情绪了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"痛苦，混乱，癫狂。他避开了那些惨痛的回忆，逼疯了自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他甚至都不知道自己犯下了什么罪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是其他人知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卫兵找到他的时候，他正在和另一个萨卡兹斗殴，酒桶被打碎，劣质酒精被点燃，蔓延到整个医疗阵地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人都等着魔王的回应，但这件事不能由你来做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交给我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴郁的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下，将军，我战胜了莱塔尼亚人，为此献出了一切！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阴郁的萨卡兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么，难道我做错了？殿下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把他带下去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他叫洛根。名字是他的母亲取的，他的母亲是巴别塔最初一批工程师中的一员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他几乎不会使用法术，守卫们却是遭到法术催眠。有其他人在背后推波助澜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"军事委员会不会为了一个外人去调查又一次闯过苦难的萨卡兹们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我希望，巴别塔也不会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们别无他法。战争刚刚结束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，这段时间，巴别塔不该再参与任何军政事务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你知道巴别塔志不在此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但很多人不这么想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会为巴别塔成员划定可以活动的范围。医疗、教育和科技建设，巴别塔将服务于此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"军事委员会对他们的保护仍然生效。但无疑尽量避免冲突才是上策。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被积压的仇恨总有一天会爆发。到那时，即使是我们......即便是我也无能为力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡兹戴尔需要尽快迎来一次变革，我们要尽快......克服源石问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这依旧解决不了所有问题，特蕾西娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g6_babeloffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿斯卡纶，你在这。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在这座城市里看到了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死......人哭......人死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哭？哭......哭泣？"},{"type":"narration","text":"特雷西斯伸出手，一柄小巧的石刃躺在他的掌心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刀！我的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿好它，作为战士，应当珍惜自己的武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会教你如何把它打磨得无比锋利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后，你要靠自己为它找到正确的方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她还没到理解这些事的时候，你太着急了，特雷西斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她迟早要明白的，特蕾西娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少现在，我们应该为这个受惊的孩子留一点镇定下来的时间——你喜欢这座城市吗，阿斯卡纶？"},{"type":"narration","text":"比起那个身穿铠甲的将军，阿斯卡纶并不喜欢这个蹲在自己面前的萨卡兹女性。\n因为她仿佛能读懂自己的一切心思，在她的面前，自己没有任何秘密——这是荒野上生存的大忌。\n但她却无法对这位温柔的萨卡兹生出敌意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用害怕我，你能看到我对你没有敌意，对吗？你可以摸摸我的角，我们是一样的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这里，温暖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，温暖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，温暖。仇恨与杀戮并不是解决问题的唯一办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......（含糊不清的发音）办法？问题？"},{"type":"narration","text":"特蕾西娅没有继续说下去，即使有魔王的帮助，生于荒野的阿斯卡纶也难以理解所有词语。\n她慢慢捧起了阿斯卡纶的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......就像你手心的伤口，武器不能让伤口恢复，只有药物和时间才能让它慢慢恢复。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呀啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事了，我已经为你清理了创口，接下来你可要小心照料它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"耐心些，等到未来某天，当你醒过来，就会发现伤口不再痛了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡兹戴尔地区，巴别塔教室"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没人。在。这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再等等，现在还不是上课的时候，他们会来的——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是你呀，特雷西斯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"军事委员会递上来一份报告，是关于这次的伤亡情况。其中有很多孩子，大部分也都是学生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些活下来的孩子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们的父母不愿意再将他们交到巴别塔的那些外族人老师手里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"况且，我记得，巴别塔的不少老师因为害怕已经离开了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西娅，你最近太过操劳这些琐事。你需要休息。我们还需要——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想再等等看，特雷西斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"narration","text":"他站在原地，并没有离开，而教室里安静得可怕。\n特蕾西娅闭上了眼，她回想起了这间教室来来去去的学生们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"学生们来了又去，以前她总有办法吸引孩子们回到这间教室。\n可这一次，没有孩子再来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_1302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特雷西斯殿下！殿下！我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你！"},{"type":"narration","text":"一柄石刃的刀柄撞上了孩子的胸口。虽然孩子无法撼动阿斯卡纶的手，但他努力挺起胸膛看着眼前这个瘦高的女孩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_1302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到特雷西斯殿下往这边走，我只是想追上——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_1302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，特蕾西娅殿下，您也在！这间教室......是您在上课吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放下刀，阿斯卡纶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_1302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......殿下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想见我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_1302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。我来帮那些失去父母的孩子求一个答案。我知道军事委员会能照顾好他们，就像照顾我一样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_1302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......这会带来任何的变化吗？如果战争又来了呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_1302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想改变，可我不知道可以改变什么，也不知道要去改变什么。"},{"type":"narration","text":"两位殿下看着这位毫无怯意的孩子，他们的心中刹那间都有了各自的答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你叫什么名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勇敢的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_1302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曼弗雷德。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g3_kazdelstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷糊的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_1303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸，我们已经在家门口站了很久了，为什么不进去呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好运","speakerId":"avg_npc_1305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好运","speakerId":"avg_npc_1305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈妈受了很重很重的伤，她需要一个人在里面休息，我们不该打扰她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷糊的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_1303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我想妈妈了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好运","speakerId":"avg_npc_1305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸也想，但是现在不行......等我办完事回来，我们再一起回家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷糊的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_1303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸要去哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好运","speakerId":"avg_npc_1305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要再出一趟城，让那些欺负妈妈的人付出代价。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好运","speakerId":"avg_npc_1305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你暂时留在这，等爸爸回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷糊的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_1303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸可以不走吗？爸爸留在这，我们一起想办法让妈妈好起来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好运","speakerId":"avg_npc_1305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你喜欢妈妈的名字吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷糊的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_1303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，喜欢，妈妈的名字很好听......奥达。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好运","speakerId":"avg_npc_1305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以后它就是你的名字了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷糊的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_1303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好运","speakerId":"avg_npc_1305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奥达，等爸爸回来，就教你用妈妈的武器打坏人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我要打那些欺负妈妈的坏人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥达","speakerId":"avg_npc_1303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，打跑了坏人，妈妈的伤就会好起来吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好运","speakerId":"avg_npc_1305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奥达......你还不明白，你以后会明白的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好运","speakerId":"avg_npc_1305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你等我回来。"},{"type":"narration","text":"好运转身离开了家门口，看向了那堵已被结晶丛林爬满的城墙。\n如今这座城内足以令他牵挂的只有奥达。\n那个奥达......还有这个奥达。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
